<section class="content-section" id="overview-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="text-content">
            <h2 class="section-title">Partnership to Pvt Ltd Conversion in Mumbai &ndash; Overview</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
                    <p><strong>&#128204; TL;DR - Partnership to Pvt Ltd Services at a Glance</strong></p>
                    <p>Partnership to Pvt Ltd conversion is the statutory re-registration of a partnership firm as a Private Limited Company under Section 366 of the Companies Act, 2013. All assets, liabilities, contracts vest automatically. Firm dissolved from incorporation date. Tax-neutral under Section 47(xiii) IT Act (conditions: same capital proportions, 5-year share holding, 50% minimum). Process: partners' resolution, newspaper ad (URC-2, 21 clear days), name reservation, URC-1 + SPICe+ Part B + MOA/AOA + AGILE PRO. Gains: limited liability, equity funding, ESOP, 25% tax rate, institutional credit. Timeline: 30-45 days.</p>
                </div>
                <p>Mumbai's traditional partnership firms &ndash; textile traders at Crawford Market, professional practices at Fort, wholesale at Dadar, jewellers at Zaveri Bazaar, manufacturing at MIDC, and multi-generational family businesses &ndash; increasingly convert to Pvt Ltd for funding, liability protection, and corporate capabilities. Learn more about <a href="/convert-partnership-to-pvt-ltd-company">Partnership to Pvt Ltd Conversion across India</a>.</p>
