                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">Which ROC handles this conversion in Mumbai?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>ROC Mumbai at Everest House processes URC-1 and SPICe+ applications. Newspaper ad in Mumbai district (English + Marathi). Registrar of Firms, Maharashtra (Pune) for partnership dissolution. Patron's Marine Lines office adjacent to ROC for direct coordination.</p></div>
