                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">Can an unregistered firm convert?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>No. Only registered firms with conversion provision in deed. Unregistered: register first (15-30 days). No conversion clause: amend deed. Patron manages registration + deed amendment + conversion as single engagement for Mumbai firms.</p></div>
