                    <div class="faq-expanded__item" id="faq-3">
                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">Do all partners need to agree?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>Yes. Unanimous consent required. Every partner becomes shareholder in same proportion as capital account. Single dissenting partner blocks conversion. Post-conversion shareholding can change. Patron coordinates consent for Mumbai firms.</p></div>
