                    <div class="faq-expanded__item" id="faq-4">
                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">Is conversion tax-neutral?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>Yes, under Section 47(xiii) IT Act: capital gains exempt if all partners become shareholders in same capital proportion, shares not transferred for 5 years, former partners hold 50% minimum for 5 years. Patron structures to meet all conditions.</p></div>
